{"id":"n24743-1-9","stage":3,"title":"입히다 · 穿上","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24743-1-9-1","ko":"강아지에게 옷을 입혔네요.","zh":"给小狗穿衣服了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"강아지에게","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입혔네요.","meaning":"穿上，裹上","explanation":"입히다：穿上，裹上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"입히다","audio":"/audio/8221250dbb2178c22fab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24743","senseId":"1","lemma":"입히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"8221250dbb2178c2","term":"입히다","zh":"穿上，裹上","audio":"/audio/8221250dbb2178c22fab.mp3","entryId":"24743","definition":"把衣服给人或动物穿上或裹身上。","pronunciation":["이피다"]}],"audio":"/audio/62aa3819a870cf816a85.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24743-1-9-2","ko":"네. 예쁘기도 하고 옷을 입혀 밖에 나가면 먼지를 덜 타거든요.","zh":"是的。这样不仅好看，而且穿上衣服带它出门的话，沾上的灰尘也会少一些。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘기도","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"肯定前面的性质（-기도 하다：也有……的一面）","explanation":"하다：肯定前面的性质（-기도 하다：也有……的一面）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷을","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입혀","meaning":"穿上，裹上","explanation":"입히다：穿上，裹上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입히다","audio":"/audio/8221250dbb2178c22fab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24743","senseId":"1","lemma":"입히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밖에","meaning":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","explanation":"밖：表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"5","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나가면","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먼지를","meaning":"灰尘","explanation":"먼지：灰尘；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"먼지","audio":"/audio/b1dc28aab0e945184eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54843","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덜","meaning":"不够，不大，还没有","explanation":"덜：不够，不大，还没有","readings":[{"term":"덜","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48653","senseId":"1","lemma":"덜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타거든요.","meaning":"沾灰","explanation":"타다：沾灰；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79456","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"肯定前面的性质（-기도 하다：也有……的一面）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"肯定前面的性质（-기도 하다：也有……的一面）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"8221250dbb2178c2","term":"입히다","zh":"穿上，裹上","audio":"/audio/8221250dbb2178c22fab.mp3","entryId":"24743","definition":"把衣服给人或动物穿上或裹身上。","pronunciation":["이피다"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"表示只有前面内容所示的状态或行为方法。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"b1dc28aab0e94518","term":"먼지","zh":"灰尘","audio":"/audio/b1dc28aab0e945184eb2.mp3","entryId":"54843","definition":"飘散在空气中或沉积在东西之上的，细微的颗粒。","pronunciation":["먼지"]},{"id":"f065d425b7fad87e","term":"덜","zh":"不够，不大，还没有","audio":"/audio/f065d425b7fad87eff3e.mp3","entryId":"48653","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度弱，在那个程度之下。","pronunciation":["덜ː"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"沾灰","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"79456","definition":"容易沾上污垢或尘土。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/af0a4ceef98aebf015e1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"